{"id":"n69585-1-8","stage":4,"title":"원화 · 韩元","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69585-1-8-1","ko":"미국에 여행을 가려고 해.","zh":"我打算去美国旅行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미국에","meaning":"美国","explanation":"미국：美国；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"미국에","audio":"/audio/985bce1e4d8dcb822374.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"여행을","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가려고","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5722ea5581591bd5238.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69585-1-8-2","ko":"그럼 원화를 달러로 바꿔야겠네.","zh":"那得把韩元换成美元了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"원화를","meaning":"韩元","explanation":"원화：韩元；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"원화","audio":"/audio/ff40ec8df5160936d29f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69585","senseId":"1","lemma":"원화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달러로","meaning":"美元，美金","explanation":"달러：美元，美金；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"달러","audio":"/audio/a3e596bb03b3896039e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57291","senseId":"1","lemma":"달러","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바꿔야겠네.","meaning":"换，更换，调换","explanation":"바꾸다：换，更换，调换；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"바꾸다","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17198","senseId":"1","lemma":"바꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"ff40ec8df5160936","term":"원화","zh":"韩元","audio":"/audio/ff40ec8df5160936d29f.mp3","entryId":"69585","definition":"以元为单位的韩国货币。","pronunciation":["원화"]},{"id":"a3e596bb03b38960","term":"달러","zh":"美元，美金","audio":"/audio/a3e596bb03b3896039e0.mp3","entryId":"57291","definition":"美国的货币。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5cc3393b01c955d1","term":"바꾸다","zh":"换，更换，调换","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3","entryId":"17198","definition":"去掉原来的东西，用其他东西替代。","pronunciation":["바꾸다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4c1181a08a9ecbe12248.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.551,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69585","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.3777,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那得把韩元换成美元了。","我们现在是结义兄弟了。","我打算去美国旅行。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那得把韩元换成美元了。","我打算去美国旅行。","我们现在是结义兄弟了。"],"